(text "COMMS. CAN1/CAN2 CA-IS3062W (VCC=+5V, 4.5-5.5V). Bus: CMC -> NUP2105L -> split termination via DIP (62R+62R, 4.7nF mid).\nRS-485 CA-IS2092W, SEL=GND_485 (3.3V VISO bus; DS: SEL=VISO only valid with VCC=5V), DIP for 120R term + 680R bias. Shields -> CHASSIS via 1M||4.7nF.\nUSB: CM5 USB2 OTG -> USB-C service/rpiboot (only external USB). CM5 USB3-0 HS -> internal header (display touch), USB3-1 HS -> internal spare header. No hub, no USB-A. No on-board modem: external router on RJ45, powered from ROUTER_12V.\nROUTER_12V: TPS1H200A from +12V, ILIM 1.0k = 2.0A, default ON (100k pull-up), STM32 power-cycles via TCA9555 @0x25 P04." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4cd09b19-d83a-4676-bb94-5b2b3b82d10d"))
)
